      "text": {
        "en": "Many shoppers praise helpful and kind team members across checkout and grooming counters, noting attentive assistance during routine visits. However, several reviewers experienced dismissive treatment or unhelpful attitudes at the till, suggesting service quality varies depending on staffing on the day."
      }
    },
