      "title": {
        "en": "Quick checkouts with occasional order delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often benefit from brisk till lines and prompt floor assistance when store traffic is light. In contrast, other customers report prolonged waiting times for assistance with specialty stock, as well as unexpected cancellations of click-and-collect orders without advance notice."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable pet stock with inventory inconsistencies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers value the availability of essential pet supplies, bulk feeder insects, and grooming goods at this spacious location. Nevertheless, critical reviews highlight occasional out-of-stock specialty diets and damaged packaging on retail shelves, prompting shoppers to check products carefully."
      }
    }
